    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) on a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA TZEENTCH** unit of yours within Engagement Range of any enemy unit. For the rest of the phase:\n\n- for choosing targets for ranged weapons and resolving their attacks, enemy units do not count as within your unit's Engagement Range\n- whenever a model from an enemy unit within your unit's Engagement Range is destroyed, roll a D6; each 5+ deals 1 [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) to your unit after the attacking unit's attacks are all resolved",
